# Table data import into dev: archive from data-export.keys (newest in data\), insert + stop, dry run, the write is
# declined (default No) — nothing is written. Then Restore data with no recorded import (back).
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down                  # Table data
Enter
wait:table data menu
Down                  # Import data
Enter
wait:stand list
Enter                 # first stand
wait:archive list
Enter                 # newest data archive
wait:mode
Enter                 # insert
wait:unique
Enter                 # stop
wait:dry run result + write question
Enter                 # "Write into …?" -> default No
wait:table data menu again
Down
Down                  # Restore data
Enter
wait:stand list
Enter
wait:work dirs (none: type a path / back)
Down                  # ← Back
Enter
wait:table data menu once more
Down
Down
Down                  # ← Back
Enter
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Quit
Enter